    "notes": "Committed harness-validation corpus. Expected selections and scores are hand-computed from the same formula the Elixir WeightedSquaredError solver implements: sum over conditions with weight > 0 of (candidate - target)^2 * weight, excluding any candidate that lacks a required condition. Ties resolve to the earliest candidate in corpus order, mirroring IlluminantMatching.best_match/4."
